    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's the \"inevitability\" of it all that gets to me. every time i save someone, i know i'm just delaying the inevitable for a little while longer. i'm just tired of being the one who has to keep the cycle going. sometimes i just think about how much easier it would be if the cycle just stopped. for everyone.",
